.git
.gitignore
.env
# `.venv*` chu khong chi `.venv`: repo co hai venv (`.venv` Python 3.13.7 va
# `.venv311` Python 3.11.9 khop CI — xem CLAUDE.md muc Commands). Pattern cu bo sot
# `.venv311`, nen `docker compose build` nap them ~1.2 GB lam build context va treo
# hang chuc phut. `.gitignore` da sua cung mot loi mau nay o PR #75.
.venv*
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
# `frontend/` la 751 MB node_modules + .next, va image nay la Python thuan:
# `Dockerfile` chay `python -m src.vehicle_sim` / uvicorn, khong phuc vu Next.js
# (compose khong co service `ivi-web` — README ghi Planned). Moi tham chieu
# `frontend/` trong `src/` deu nam trong comment/docstring, khong phai luc runtime.
frontend/
.ai-log/
docs/
presentation/
eval/
# 150 MB PDF nguon, chi dung luc `python -m src.rag.cli ingest` sinh ra
# data/rag/. Luc chay backend khong doc file nao trong day — no chi lam nang
# build context. Thu muc data/rag/ (artifact that su can) VAN duoc giu lai.
data/manuals/
*.md
!requirements.txt
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
